\]
\[
729 \times 11 = 8019
\]
\[
729 \times 12 = 8748
\]
\[
729 \times 13 = 9477
\]

These are the multiples of $729$ that are greater than $6561$ and less than $59049$.

Now, count these multiples:

\[
\boxed{5}
\]
