Problem:
Below is the graph of an ellipse. (Assume that tick marks are placed every $1$ unit along the axes.)
[asy]
size(8cm);

int x, y;
for (y = -10; y <= 2; ++y) {
  draw((-0.6,y/3)--(2.4,y/3),gray(0.7));
}
for (x = -1; x <= 7; ++x) {
  draw((x/3,-3.5)--(x/3,1),gray(0.7));
}

draw(shift((1,-2))*xscale(2/3)*Circle((0,0),1));
draw((0,-3.5)--(0,1),EndArrow);
